---
import PublicLayout from '../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';

const updated = '13 November 2026';
---

<PublicLayout
  title="Terms of use — Hustler Community Opportunities"
  description="Terms for using the Hustler Community Opportunities directory, submitting opportunities, reporting listings and applying to roles."
>
  <header class="page-head">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span aria-current="page">Terms</span>
      </nav>
      <div class="page-head__inner" style="margin-top:1.25rem">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--brand">Legal</span>
          <h1>Terms of use</h1>
          <p>Plain-language terms for using this directory. Last updated {updated}.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container--narrow prose">
      <h2>1. What this site is</h2>
      <p>
        Hustler Community Opportunities is a curated directory of startup opportunities. We collect, review and publish
        listings that originate with founders, recruiters, startup teams or public submissions. We are not a recruitment
        agency, an employer, or a party to any application or employment relationship.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Listings are informational</h2>
      <p>
        A listing reflects information available in its original source at the time of review. Roles can change or close
        without notice. We show “Not specified” when a detail was not provided, and we do not guarantee that a listing
        is complete, current or accurate. Always confirm details with the hiring team before making a decision.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Applications happen elsewhere</h2>
      <p>
        Application links take you to a third-party site, an email client or the original post. We do not receive,
        process or screen applications, and we cannot confirm whether an application was received. Outbound clicks are
        tracked anonymously for aggregate reporting; they are not applications.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Submissions</h2>
      <p>
        By submitting an opportunity you confirm that you have the right to share the information and that it describes
        a real role. Public submissions are always reviewed and may be edited, rejected or removed. Submitting a role
        does not guarantee publication. Do not submit confidential information, candidate data or content you do not have
        permission to share.
      </p>
      <p>
        You grant us permission to store, summarise and display the submitted listing details and to link to the original
        public source. Raw source text remains private.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Reporting</h2>
      <p>
        Use the report link on a listing to flag a closed role, a broken link, incorrect information, a duplicate or a
        suspicious listing. Reports are reviewed by an editor. Deliberately false or abusive reports may be ignored, and
        repeated abuse may be blocked.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Acceptable use</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Do not scrape, mirror or resell the directory or its data without permission.</li>
        <li>Do not attempt to access the admin workspace, other users' data or private source captures.</li>
        <li>Do not submit malware, phishing links, discriminatory roles or fraudulent opportunities.</li>
        <li>Do not use the site to harass candidates, companies or community members.</li>
        <li>Do not interfere with the security, availability or integrity of the service.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The Hustler Community name, logo and brand assets belong to their respective owners. Listing text is derived
        from the original source and remains the property of its author. The directory's design, code and editorial
        structure are protected by applicable law. You may share links to public listings.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        The directory links to third-party websites and posts. We do not control those sites and are not responsible for
        their content, availability or privacy practices. Following a link is at your own discretion.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Availability and changes</h2>
      <p>
        The service is provided on an “as available” basis. We may change, suspend or discontinue parts of the directory,
        including individual listings, at any time. We may update these terms; the date above shows the current version.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the extent permitted by law, Hustler Community and its operators are not liable for indirect or consequential
        loss arising from use of the directory, reliance on a listing, or an interaction with a third-party employer.
        Nothing in these terms excludes liability that cannot legally be excluded.
      </p>

      <h2>11. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms can be sent through the <a href="/report">report form</a> or the
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/hustlercommunity/home" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >official Hustler Community LinkedIn page</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</PublicLayout>
